# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
#
# milos (Qualcomm SM7635, Fairphone 6) family configuration, merged over
# arch/arm64/configs/defconfig:
#
#   scripts/kconfig/merge_config.sh -m .config luma/config/milos.fragment
#   make olddefconfig
#
# Every option the FP6 kernel 7.1.2-luma-fp-ims1.gmu2.selinux1 had on and
# defconfig lacks, in savedefconfig order; options defconfig turns on stay on.
# Root-path drivers (UFS PHY, display, clocks, PMIC) are built in: the boot
# image ramdisk carries no modules for this kernel. The shared Luma options
# (SELinux and the LSM order, binder, zram, container netfilter, BTF, CFI)
# belong in luma/config/luma.fragment on the base.

